%description:
Tests RFC 6298 section 5.7: after a SYN timeout, an RTO below 3 s is 3 s when
the data transmission begins. The client has an initial RTO of 1 s. The tester
removes the first SYN and the first data segment: the data segment is sent
again after 3 s, not after 1 s (tcp_rto_params_1 shows 1 s without the SYN
timeout).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="2.0 500"
*.cli_tcp.initialRto = 1s
*.tcptester.script="a1 delete; a4 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[1.001 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[1.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 250500:250500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[1.005 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 250501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[2.001 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:501(500) ack 250501 win 16384 # deleting
[5.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:501(500) ack 250501 win 16384 
[5.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 6298 section 5.7: the SYN timer expired, the RTO is 3s
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
